        "2.  Remove the `cases.case_id` column, as it's a unique identifier and not suitable for correlation.\n",
        "3.  Convert the `demographic.year_of_death` column to a numeric type, as it represents a year.\n",
        "4.  For all other `object` type columns, convert them to numerical categories using `.astype('category').cat.codes`. This maps each unique string value to an integer."
      ]
